Implemented and deployed ceeff50: SHA-256 hashed owner-bound keys with independent grants, create/import/list/revoke CLI, optional expiry and persistent revocation. Explicitly bound the existing Codex/agent key to the verified owner for default/remote/coding-agent/search, no admin, no automatic expiry; secret and agent configs unchanged. Private SQLite backup taken. Public/loopback identity and permissions passed; remote 20 and coding-agent 29 tools; live temporary-key revocation passed; same existing key survived a second restart. make check and 1325 tests pass with 100% coverage. Updated docs and verified 111 links plus bootstrap examples. External real-host/device gates remain pending.
